stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Initiated : Customer submits payment request (FR-09)

    Initiated --> FundsHeld : Fraud checks pass & Wallet has sufficient funds (FR-11, FR-12)
    Initiated --> Rejected : Fraud check fails OR Insufficient funds (FR-18)

    FundsHeld --> SentToBiller : Request dispatched to biller adapter

    SentToBiller --> Completed : Biller confirms (PAID) (FR-09)
    SentToBiller --> Failed : Biller refuses (Error code / Rejection) (FR-12)
    SentToBiller --> Unknown : No response within 10s timeout (FR-13)

    Unknown --> Completed : Biller confirms later (Async callback / Retry query / Settlement file)
    Unknown --> Failed : Biller later refuses OR Nightly reconciliation confirms no payment (FR-26)

    Failed --> Refunded : Held funds released back to customer wallet (FR-12)

    Rejected --> [*]
    Completed --> [*]
    Refunded --> [*]

    note right of Unknown
        A payment in UNKNOWN is NEVER refunded automatically!
        Money stays held until conclusive verification (FR-13).
    end note

    note right of Completed
        Hold is captured into permanent debit.
        Agent commission is credited if applicable (FR-17).
    end note
